# since 0.7 and the v10-audio clones)]. The voice file is res://assets/v10/mj/stage/voice/<hero>_<event>_<n>.ogg
# (n = 1..3 for match events, 1 for table events). A missing file is fine: the subtitle still plays.
#
# Rules for every line (checked by stage_selftest (7)): short (≤ 32 characters, she talks while you play), no
# words from UX_RULES §4.3 and V10Lint.BANNED, never about money, never guilt, no jargon («риичи» etc. are only in
# the Japanese voice; the subtitle says what it means in plain Russian, UX §4.2).

